{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "39a6c7a0-9ff1-4f13-9431-7a5f341d1dd3",
    "name": "Testes Cadastro API",
    "description": "> &lt;p &gt;Collection para praticar testes de API com CRUD completo (Create, Read, Update, Delete) e testes negativos. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p &gt;Inclui validações de status code, campos retornados e comportamentos de erro em endpoints da API JSONPlaceholder.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "24046725",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/24046725-39a6c7a0-9ff1-4f13-9431-7a5f341d1dd3?source=collection_link"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Testes Positivo",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Criar Cadastro",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// Teste de Status\r",
                  "pm.test(\"Status code é 201\", function () {\r",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);\r",
                  "});\r",
                  "\r",
                  "// Validar campos do usuário criado\r",
                  "pm.test(\"Usuário criado contém os dados corretos\", function () {\r",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();\r",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.name).to.eql(\"Rafaela QA\");\r",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.username).to.eql(\"rafaqa\");\r",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.email).to.eql(\"rafaela@example.com\");\r",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property(\"id\");\r",
                  " });"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\r\n  \"name\": \"Rafaela QA\",\r\n  \"username\": \"rafaqa\",\r\n  \"email\": \"rafaela@example.com\"\r\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "users"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Buscar Todos Cadastros",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code é 200\", function () {\r",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);\r",
                  "});\r",
                  "\r",
                  "pm.test(\"Retorna lista de usuários\", function () {\r",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();\r",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.be.an(\"array\");\r",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/9999",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "users",
                "9999"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Atualizar Cadastro",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code é 200\", function () {\r",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);\r",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\r\n  \"name\": \"Rafaela QA Atualizada\",\r\n  \"username\": \"rafaqa\",\r\n  \"email\": \"rafaela.updated@example.com\"\r\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "users",
                "{{userId}}"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "**Contém testes que verificam como a API reage a requisições inválidas ou incompletas. Inclui:**\n\n- Criar usuário sem enviar body (POST)\n    \n- Buscar usuário inexistente (GET)\n    \n- Atualizar usuário com dados inválidos (PUT)\n    \n\nEsses testes ajudam a validar a robustez e tratamento de erros da API."
    },
    {
      "name": "Testes Negativo",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Cadastro Sem Dados",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code não é 201\", function () {\r",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.not.equal(201);\r",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "users"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
